<title>GERMANY: Tarkett 9-month net profit higher.</title>
<headline>Tarkett 9-month net profit higher.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKENTHAL, Germany 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				   42.5    vs 25.6</p>
<p>Earnings before writedowns on</p>
<p>    goodwill and before financial income 94.6    vs 107.2</p>
<p>    Earnings per share			 1.44    vs 1.71 dmk</p>
<p>    Sales					  1,007   vs 1,013</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German flooring manufacturer is Tarkett AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
